{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive by eliminating the endless waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has a boss zombie that must be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You must upgrade your fighting skills and fight against the zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features arcade-style gameplay and simple controls for a truly engaging, striking experience. Even if you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don't know the language, you can still enjoy the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a virus spreads across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an unknown city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a family luckily survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are a family of three generations living together, skilled in martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They survive by eliminating zombies using martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days passed, the zombies increased in number, threatening the family's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The family was terrified of the zombies, but they survived by eliminating them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They lived day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they discovered the presence of a zombie commanding the zombies. To eliminate them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they began to eliminate zombies throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028610?t=1773633462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028610/ea669b3778d6a34f4c16d3928d58158169547e4b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773633462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028610/586caffca78c441237ba2d359fbace351ab03135/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773633462"